<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1>COLL 100 <em><span class="nowrap">Physical Intelligence:</span><br />Robots</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-lede"><em>How do intelligent robots perceive the world, know where they are, and decide what to do next?</em></p>
    <p class="hero-lede">In this hands-on course, students work with 5G-connected robotic vehicles on a reconfigurable roadway with programmable smart traffic lights in the Vehicle Computing&nbsp;Lab.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="#experiments">Explore more <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11M11 5l5 5-5 5"></path></svg></a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="#platforms">See our robots</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Vehicle Computing Lab test vehicle">
    <div class="visual-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <img
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/hands-on-activity.jpg`}
      alt="Students during a hands-on activity in the Vehicle Computing Lab"
      width="1600"
      height="900"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="live-chip"><i></i> Experiential Learning</div>
    <div class="visual-note">
      <strong>Perception <b>/</b> Planning <b>/</b> Control</strong>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="learning-cycle" aria-labelledby="learning-cycle-title" style={`--card-pattern: url(${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/wm-pattern-green.png)`}>
  <h2 id="learning-cycle-title">Learning Cycle:</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 7a11 11 0 0 0-6.5 19.9c1.6 1.2 2.5 2.8 2.5 4.6V33h8v-1.5c0-1.8.9-3.4 2.5-4.6A11 11 0 0 0 24 7Zm-4 31h8m-6 4h4"></path></svg>
      <div><h3>Plan</h3><p>Ask a focused question and predict what the robot will do.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M31 8a9 9 0 0 0-8.5 11.9L9 33.4a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 5l13.5-13.5A9 9 0 0 0 39.6 15l-5.4 5.4-5.6-1-1-5.6L33 8.4A9 9 0 0 0 31 8Z"></path></svg>
      <div><h3>Build and Test</h3><p>Use provided hardware, starter code, and visual tools to configure and test a behavior.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="9" width="32" height="22" rx="2"></rect><path d="M24 31v5m-8 6 8-6 8 6M15 25l6-6 4 4 8-8"></path></svg>
      <div><h3>Show</h3><p>Present a short team demonstration.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10h24v17H17l-6 6v-6H7Z"></path><path d="M35 17h6v17h-4v6l-6-6H19v-3"></path></svg>
      <div><h3>Explain and Reflect</h3><p>Use evidence to explain results, including surprises, limitations, and improvements.</p></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="learning-photos">
    <figure><img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/learning-plan.jpg`} alt="Students planning on laptops in the Vehicle Computing Lab" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /><figcaption class="photo-chip"><i></i> Plan a Question</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/learning-build.jpg`} alt="A student team testing a robot vehicle outdoors on campus" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /><figcaption class="photo-chip"><i></i> Test in Real World</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/learning-show.jpg`} alt="A student presenting a team demonstration to the class" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /><figcaption class="photo-chip"><i></i> Present a Demo</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/learning-explain.jpg`} alt="Students discussing simulation results shown on the lab screen" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /><figcaption class="photo-chip"><i></i> Discussion</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>
